// Hungry Ghosts (SCPS-15046) ELF CRC 798E3212: generated by scripts/pnach_options.py.
// Toggle groups in PCSX2: Game Properties -> Patches. Fan groups are guarded and pick-one
// within a family (camera speed, aspect ratio); restart the game after changing them.
gametitle=Hungry Ghosts (J)(SCPS-15046)

[Modern controls (fan patch)]
author=Mord of Swoonlight
description=Modern dual-analog controls. Left stick: move + strafe. Right stick: look + turn. R1: attack (hold to charge or aim, release to strike/throw/fire). L1 + right stick: manual arm. L3: dash toggle. R3: recenter view. Already built into the Modern Controls edition. Don't tick together with Classic controls (Classic would win). Takes effect at boot.
// Guarded: applies only over the original code (any CRC), and not after Classic controls.
